{
  "about": "Markdown-lite of the assistant's answers → the HTML structure. Pinned by src/ui_vectors.rs (assistant::render_markdown) and scripts/shared-vectors.test.mjs (shared/js/markdown.js, no link callback). Normalised: no line breaks between elements, no class attributes, text escaped as & < > \" ' ; item numbers are left out (each app links them its own way).",
  "cases": [
    ["", ""],
    ["Hello", "<p>Hello</p>"],
    ["one\ntwo", "<p>one<br>two</p>"],
    ["one\n\ntwo", "<p>one</p><p>two</p>"],
    ["> quoted", "<p>quoted</p>"],
    ["# Title\n### Sub", "<h3>Title</h3><h4>Sub</h4>"],
    ["#nospace", "<p>#nospace</p>"],
    ["- a\n- b\n1. c\n2) d", "<ul><li>a</li><li>b</li></ul><ol><li>c</li><li>d</li></ol>"],
    ["* star\n• dot", "<ul><li>star</li><li>dot</li></ul>"],
    ["text\n- item", "<p>text</p><ul><li>item</li></ul>"],
    ["---", "<hr>"],
    ["a **bold** b", "<p>a <strong>bold</strong> b</p>"],
    ["a **open", "<p>a **open</p>"],
    ["`x < y`", "<p><code>x &lt; y</code></p>"],
    ["one ` tick", "<p>one ` tick</p>"],
    ["```\nfn main() {}\n<b>\n```", "<pre><code>fn main() {}\n&lt;b&gt;</code></pre>"],
    ["| A | B |\n|---|:-:|\n| 1 | **2** |", "<div><table><thead><tr><th>A</th><th>B</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><strong>2</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"],
    ["| not | a table |\nplain", "<p>| not | a table |<br>plain</p>"],
    ["<script>alert('x')</script> & \"q\"", "<p>&lt;script&gt;alert(&#39;x&#39;)&lt;/script&gt; &amp; &quot;q&quot;</p>"]
  ]
}
